{"about_the_game":"<strong>Become a mad scientist in search of the ultimate mutagen!</strong><br>Here, you can outshine even the famous Frankenstein with your incredible mutants! Prove your genius once and for all and let nobody stop you.<br><br>Creature Lab sets you on a difficult path of a genius, yet a bit wicked scientist with a very liberal approach to test subjects and official procedures. Establish your hideout and let the experiments commence! Conduct crazy experiments, mix mutagens, analyze their properties, grow DNA-based body parts, and attach them to your test subjects. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/1ab222b2b8a87a3dd14f39bf195b1ae6.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/1ab222b2b8a87a3dd14f39bf195b1ae6.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>So many possibilities\u2026 Prepare your laboratory, obtain basic reagents, and see what happens when you mix them together. Don\u2019t forget to name all your recipes! Apply your mutagens to test subjects and observe how they react. Grow entirely new body parts and attach them to the creatures you just brought to life. Discover nearly limitless interactions between mutagens and body parts as you slowly assemble an army of mutants. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/02556d18798d246c63569fcf8438f58d.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/02556d18798d246c63569fcf8438f58d.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>There's no use hoping for government funds so you'll make do with anything you can find or even steal. Manage your inventory, expand your lab, and make sure your hideout is safe. Don\u2019t let the panic guide you, the more stressed you are, the bigger chance Feds will drop by to say hello and check your spot! Don\u2019t leave any traces, be patient and extremely careful! They will never even know what hit them! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/7ff8f2debb8b14bdef0067d27a8575aa.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/7ff8f2debb8b14bdef0067d27a8575aa.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Running low on resources? Need more test subjects? Send your sick creatures into the city! Find whatever resources you need. Spread panic in the city to scare off anyone trying to find your hideout. And if the military starts looking for you, send the strongest of your creatures to teach them a lesson. Let no one stop you in your search for the ultimate mutagen!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-person mad scientist simulator<br></li><li>Complex resource and inventory management<br></li><li>A strategy element - plan raids on the city and prepare for encounters with the military<br></li><li>Thousands of different mutagens to discover - you name them all<br></li><li>Unique body parts to grow and attach to your test subjects<br></li><li>A unique fear mechanic that lowers the chance of your hideout being discovered<br></li><li>Singleplayer campaign mode<br></li><li>Endless replayability with new substances every time you play</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/57c240e9af613c5c5eeaedbf4f826face5ed27aa.jpg"},{"name":"Another thesis completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/c096f759e9e9ea01badec3825f14d67e63c986e8.jpg"},{"name":"Modern Frankenstein","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/ce37e97ed08a7a9e60e86b070ad24cca0153438e.jpg"},{"name":"Baby steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/d5aebadad799565c5f056a6095a46fdcf9adfda3.jpg"},{"name":"Asylum assault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/457b2d970ae9c8b32945e65333ed2fb40a5a0f83.jpg"},{"name":"No Pharma is Safe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/400687bf7d2261ca46cf4a67179c160d1ac7993b.jpg"},{"name":"Grand theft documento","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/4b551dee1966273320ab5e3b15cc0f5c54c12e4c.jpg"},{"name":"Stranger\u2019s gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/cfb13d66eed945723e4c8b5b429990ae02af4488.jpg"},{"name":"Ultimate Achievement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/6138a31567bc8c6d1fbcbffaf45be25f2920ec23.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s what I deserve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1309990/7b5863cf79eb3f0e46df0ff602c498a37647360c.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1309990?t=1761041198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761041198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761041198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761041198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game allows the player to change limbs of their test subjects. The player can also use captured bodies for their experiments and turn them into monsters (Frankenstein-like). There is some blood visible on the models. Acts of violence are not explicitly shown."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1882310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Become a mad scientist in search of the ultimate mutagen!</strong><br>Here, you can outshine even the famous Frankenstein with your incredible mutants! Prove your genius once and for all and let nobody stop you.<br><br>Creature Lab sets you on a difficult path of a genius, yet a bit wicked scientist with a very liberal approach to test subjects and official procedures. Establish your hideout and let the experiments commence! Conduct crazy experiments, mix mutagens, analyze their properties, grow DNA-based body parts, and attach them to your test subjects. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/1ab222b2b8a87a3dd14f39bf195b1ae6.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/1ab222b2b8a87a3dd14f39bf195b1ae6.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>So many possibilities\u2026 Prepare your laboratory, obtain basic reagents, and see what happens when you mix them together. Don\u2019t forget to name all your recipes! Apply your mutagens to test subjects and observe how they react. Grow entirely new body parts and attach them to the creatures you just brought to life. Discover nearly limitless interactions between mutagens and body parts as you slowly assemble an army of mutants. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/02556d18798d246c63569fcf8438f58d.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/02556d18798d246c63569fcf8438f58d.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>There's no use hoping for government funds so you'll make do with anything you can find or even steal. Manage your inventory, expand your lab, and make sure your hideout is safe. Don\u2019t let the panic guide you, the more stressed you are, the bigger chance Feds will drop by to say hello and check your spot! Don\u2019t leave any traces, be patient and extremely careful! They will never even know what hit them! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/7ff8f2debb8b14bdef0067d27a8575aa.poster.avif?t=1761041198\" width=620 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/extras/7ff8f2debb8b14bdef0067d27a8575aa.webm?t=1761041198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Running low on resources? Need more test subjects? Send your sick creatures into the city! Find whatever resources you need. Spread panic in the city to scare off anyone trying to find your hideout. And if the military starts looking for you, send the strongest of your creatures to teach them a lesson. Let no one stop you in your search for the ultimate mutagen!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>First-person mad scientist simulator<br></li><li>Complex resource and inventory management<br></li><li>A strategy element - plan raids on the city and prepare for encounters with the military<br></li><li>Thousands of different mutagens to discover - you name them all<br></li><li>Unique body parts to grow and attach to your test subjects<br></li><li>A unique fear mechanic that lowers the chance of your hideout being discovered<br></li><li>Singleplayer campaign mode<br></li><li>Endless replayability with new substances every time you play</li></ul>","developers":["Image Power S.A."],"dlc":[2447620],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309990/header.jpg?t=1761041198","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1309990/577225/0cfd45fab5432f11c1b4de22a6c8fe2d88cf5ba6/1750671424/dash_av1.mpd?t=1686735958","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1309990/577225/0cfd45fab5432f11c1b4de22a6c8fe2d88cf5ba6/1750671424/dash_h264.mpd?t=1686735958","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1309990/577225/0cfd45fab5432f11c1b4de22a6c8fe2d88cf5ba6/1750671424/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1686735958","id":256952310,"name":"Final Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256952310/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1686735958"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1309990/512060/b9f99c0dd00e0aeffdaa4db698a4ec45fb1d32a2/1750671418/dash_av1.mpd?t=168